flowchart TD
  P[Seller · warehouse · courier apps] -- status events --> OS[Order service<br/>state machine]
  OS --> DB[(orders · status_history · outbox)]
  DB -. outbox .-> K{{Kafka: order-status}}
  K --> N[Notifications<br/>push · SMS · email]
  K --> L[Live update fan-out]
  L -- "pub/sub order:{id}" --> CS[Connection servers<br/>SSE / WebSocket]
  CS --> C[Customers watching]
  CR[Courier app] -- location every 4 s --> LS[Location service<br/>latest position · throttled]
  LS --> CS
